#: omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01c60d7db152ccb878e4107284eac14b427dd935126a69b38a78b26b7dd7f89a
#. default-sha256: 3b832fef7424633dd2016a374b61606da515208bfa1e8a85fa0cb4791c812cd5
msgctxt "omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The fact that you’re here means you’ve uncovered all the mansion’s mysteries, yes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫여기까지 다다른 걸 보니, ⟪k:2⟫저택의 수수께끼를 밝혀낸 거지?"

#: omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a5754f4cd34fe988a60fc6b9873c0625b142f4084732284d79b1c3bbd625958
#. default-sha256: ee02d1b1cc084c1dd18004cce3510dac8182ddc7286595ee958ee793d099065c
msgctxt "omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫My congratulations for having the fortitude to endure such a... ⟪k:3⟫grim "
"tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……후후……, ⟪k:2⟫칭찬해 줄게.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫적어도 ⟪k:5⟫처참한 이야기를 견딜 힘은 있나 보잖아."

#: omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7787bbf42b237f85b3ed291e33ee67e6a6078f4dc75b590dbc6438e17080d122
#. default-sha256: 173cf071e409b82a837cbc63d5697d25545a7c6d56fc3efe39933aad60bb5ced
msgctxt "omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is, if you’re willing to take this hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이런 손이라도 ⟪k:3⟫잡을 수 있다면 말이야."

#: omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46f408308740b3324413e955c5bbb7aaf48a140b0c4c0e17052f3f5ec8089ba5
#. default-sha256: 2bc537b16a07088d10a0cdc60c78e9cc8d3973e852e400888a3af5c1c768f888
msgctxt "omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That said, I would prefer not to have to guide you around the house all by myself. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Not because I have anything in particular against you, of course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도 ⟪k:2⟫나와 너 둘이서 저택을 돌아다니긴 좀 그렇지.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫네가 ⟪k:5⟫싫단 뜻은 아"
"니야."

#: omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 289547462e053f2639b11b6ff40138cc31ffe78e5e3083d039e9f6a4b334054d
#. default-sha256: 3394c05c9356baaee913edb51d5407a9ac301ff6ae4f8b5077205be72b201ef3
msgctxt "omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I simply think it would be inappropriate for him not to accompany us—⟪k:2⟫yes, him. "
"This story’s protagonist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫역시 이럴 때는…… ⟪k:2⟫그 사람도 같이 가야 하지 않겠어?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그래, ⟪k:5⟫이 작품의…… "
"“주인공”도."

#: omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6714f308de1c88305e111455ef333af48185429acc9e29db42aa5424e38eef97
#. default-sha256: aef5cc53305be7844e1628e01f40fe1365c4c6c9e05deca6d9f738e3ac825870
msgctxt "omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D-⟪k:2⟫Don’t worry! When I was in her position, I closed my eyes and plugged my ears "
"when you were doing your business!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫앗, ⟪k:2⟫괜찮아요! ⟪k:3⟫제 때는 ⟪k:4⟫눈 감고 귀 막았어요!"

#: omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 018ee3d8fc465b9618cc44b08a62223b774fb3881a3b52dfcf091f1d1df7f0d8
#. default-sha256: 5f98783c1da9459d80e31d2c965f0009a1cce0568c44f709c11eac4cb7fbda98
msgctxt "omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In some ways, you could call the first four chapters an extended prologue."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어떤 의미론 긴 서장이었지."

#: omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c34e7003249aaa3414681e520aae15d61b19bbc3f51eb21f0cb4b8a515e21c
#. default-sha256: 6ef92945e5bf49918c1607c1c12a405297c8cd2818631fc9079dee7fca5fbd95
msgctxt "omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aww! What about me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어어, ⟪k:2⟫왜요!"

#: omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7d0f49a9143131eab31e74ead8773c5f45c840bc72208bc4d2f0d43408793f2
#. default-sha256: b7e9fbd8bdcd11be5db3ad02ae8074f4d057d0d4cbeef9ea93be78a97a198c1d
msgctxt "omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because with you around, he turns into a lovesick, airheaded dope. ⟪k:3⟫He’s about "
"as useful to me as a wet paper sack full of potatoes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지젤이 곁에 있으면 ⟪k:3⟫그냥 얼타는 염장맨이 되잖아. ⟪k:4⟫산통 다 깨져."

#: omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f713009aaf9eca29fb8ae47b47f20be5c884932978e77e4801ebe320cb7054ae
#. default-sha256: 87bf1c26b0f74787dac95d7dbdd8170c902e80c62f66ee56bf3554ce59db554a
msgctxt "omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Absolutely not.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You spoil him—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫in more ways than one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫안 돼, ⟪k:3⟫너는 미셸을 틈만 나면 오냐오냐하잖아."

#: omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca89d37b08fd2bac4bc1d23b4e7acc70ac14647acb057f4078ee0086b1769eff
#. default-sha256: bf20c1e5a0095e7a383f05a159cd2cc0074536b8ce3f84f452e8fdaddf6c9a26
msgctxt "omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What are we going to do, though?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런데 ⟪k:2⟫나가서 뭐 하게……?"

#: omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a03f527888ff3aafbd6822445043f32585d9247c1768c4961c4d124612aabf6
#. default-sha256: 28a3368f9e98658a02125875ee191a999bc7b2b33d2a0b8649134afd8d621d34
msgctxt "omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I seem to recall plenty of faffing about in the main game anyway;⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫why "
"don’t we do something we ⟪k:5⟫couldn’t⟪k:6⟫ do there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫막말하는 건 본편에서도 했으니, ⟪k:2⟫무대 뒤만의 다른 무언가를 하는 게 낫지 않을까."

#: omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c40bcd594fafb765ced27f0c95146da636ec555ec5f53dd0b02e1876c4c3906e
#. default-sha256: b87bfd80b2ca235dcc21931dcb0a696da100efad174f358921d6be57319a5b0e
msgctxt "omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ve got profiles and other miscellaneous notes from the creators about each of the "
"characters. ⟪k:2⟫I thought they might come in handy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫제작자들의 ⟪k:2⟫각 캐릭터 설정이나 이런저런 주저리가 적힌 쪽지예요. ⟪k:3⟫이걸 가져가면 "
"되지 않을까요."

#: omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3269e364e62df8f7564d23cf9cc9596439a74c268d23195a97a39d316700779e
#. default-sha256: d77fc069c15303ef4c80428a36edff22abc7b840f36d4682eefe9893b4413ad8
msgctxt "omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can see them being useful, yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but why exactly do you ⟪k:4⟫have⟪k:5⟫ "
"those?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그건 좋은데……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그대가 왜 그런 걸 가지고 있습니까……?"

#: omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1992f831b876e0173b0c99ff2797b54347e89a39dac68bc06ca33ab3ee3381a3
#. default-sha256: b34161c0e282fbad05a160b80edf9a214da34ed6e4b75b3d84595bb4f0f84151
msgctxt "omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I’d rather pretend those miniaturized ⟪k:2⟫things⟪k:3⟫ were not actually us...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(그 쬐끄만 것들을 우리라 여기긴 싫은데……)"

#: omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82f4e9c44b4ab867b2215e7173276c547ec3593961558cd88456058daae4bc34
#. default-sha256: 38720799c697489e75665fc38e935404a46eb34f2999b89304d9853f39b647fa
msgctxt "omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hand over the cue cards."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그럼 ⟪k:3⟫쪽지 좀 볼게."

#: omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23d0b586063e3f1e06ca22d8b1eb73a575077479b60d87854f2aadd2cee698d8
#. default-sha256: fd6c399f6e74e43101cd02cba13a2b6e026ccba8b8244c0372222c66eec1a582
msgctxt "omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The second chapter was pretty crazy too!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we found out about, ⟪k:5⟫"
"uh, ⟪k:6⟫Ukulele, that was it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫2장의 그 사람도 엄청났죠, ⟪k:3⟫그 왜, ⟪k:4⟫우키마사 씨요!"

#: omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48be4081e09e0e2fc55a4f28d85b3c458c4562e73f3a445899652508992a041c
#. default-sha256: 860189d2d9fcc50547982d1de4f97031278e17d56920b08601406019d579ed25
msgctxt "omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Ahaha.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Chapter three was something else too.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My impression of "
"Jacopo and Maria had completely turned around by the end."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫아하하. ⟪k:2⟫3장도 그런 의미론 ⟪k:3⟫야코포 씨나 마리아나 ⟪k:4⟫끝에 가서 인상이 확 변"
"하죠."

#: omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf1ac563ee4a707b45f930f5e1324c5273aedd539a40fba13c614bde713567f6
#. default-sha256: 46c5657bbfc0dc4a55381ca70bf3744ff6d5855ac9621b5e51dc2049c782e2f6
msgctxt "omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Piles of human garbage, the three of them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫정말이지, ⟪k:1⟫그 세 남자는 개쓰레기라니깐."

#: omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 369be31b4d1ad54ec3edacac177c162fde6e8f67236b60f39abdb16bb4209d17
#. default-sha256: b04455c648ebf1cd19e63b8c1401522c2e8f664a1340317fb194aa127ad477b1
msgctxt "omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫..................⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Wha?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………엥."

#: omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6991a8d87bc96bd3f463f00f63797d35562433fac8e1e7c4594556e3bb2f9c4b
#. default-sha256: f81d6e6ef2c657fbbcb898249a39b3d3c0a32b2d39c8916f7d5dbeb613d18883
msgctxt "omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I, ⟪k:2⟫um... ⟪k:3⟫wasn’t expecting something so...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫flattering to come out of "
"your mouth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그게……, ⟪k:2⟫그런 좋은 단어가 나올 줄은 몰랐거든……."

#: omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da9e65c71376ddaa5718888c3d98bedb0b4dbec3003955c389353db39b98d334
#. default-sha256: 3117caa26a35e7979fb0d4ef78ebf7260a182ae61e7f01a5184419bdec6e3305
msgctxt "omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s true.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Putting a knife to a woman’s neck isn’t very righteous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그렇지, ⟪k:3⟫여자에게 나이프를 들이민 건 많이 심했어."

#: omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb5ed98744cbe7560739e16835c04f7b7001bfd6980f6ab249d79a50f8b2af6d
#. default-sha256: 79c362553bc6e95e2c483cd7199cd48c20a134fd4baad3bb27c965cbb652f96a
msgctxt "omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anyway. While those are the core aspects of your character, they got buried over "
"the course of the abuse and misfortune you suffered throughout the story."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐, ⟪k:3⟫그런 근본적인 성질은 존재하지만, ⟪k:4⟫고초를 많이 겪어서 그게 가려지는 거"
"야."

#: omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3c38fc4dae8ac0a27fe77d280b5ac8d26a7426c3a512b647e2d873d06cee544
#. default-sha256: 413471f3c6b981d7612b04fd8d8feb903fe970ca0a37874a2ede601ae26a8a96
msgctxt "omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How all the promotional material portrays me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫공식이 나를 다루는 꼬라지."

#: omake:omake_1BE9E555_DCC5_4A99_AF04_16EBAFE32490
